            "review_text": "Adrian Lee\nSemenyih, Malaysia7078 contributions\n0\nMr. Adrian Lee\nAug 2019\nHad Thai foodies along the street of food inside of Hanoi Lotte Centre. Lovely Tomyam Shrimp Seafood With Chicken, had the long beans with balacan and Mango Salad was lovely and tasty. The wonderful thing is the green curry chicken was simply amazing with its curry powder and the crispy shrimp toast was their signature dish. Can’t get enough of its Vietnamese coffee ice milk in Vietnam 🇻🇳🇻🇳😋😋\nRead more\nWritten August 3, 2019",
